OL,3,GNEWSADelivery of new CalMac ferry MV
OL,4,AGlen Rosa put back to February
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe expected handover date of the
OL,7,Flong-delayed CalMac ferry MV Glen Rosa
OL,8,Fhas been put back by another two months
OL,9,Funtil next February.
OL,11,FThe dual-fuel ship being built by the
OL,12,Fstate-owned Ferguson shipyard was
OL,13,Fexpected to be ready by the end of the
OL,14,Fyear, and had originally been due for
OL,15,Fdelivery in 2018.
OL,17,FTransport Secretary Stephen Flynn said
OL,18,Fhe had been told by the firm's boss
OL,19,Fthat the yard could deliver the ship by
OL,20,Fthe end of the year but officials had
OL,21,Frecommended a short delay to allow for
OL,22,Fthe fitting of redesigned propellers.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
