OL,3,GNEWSADelivery of new CalMac ferry MV
OL,4,AGlen Rosa put back to February
OL,5,
OL,6,FFerguson Marine is still assessing the
OL,7,Fimpact on overall cost for the ship,
OL,8,Falready well over #200m which is more
OL,9,Fthan four times the original contract
OL,10,Fprice.
